flowchart LR
  S0["<b>Stage 0: everything up</b><br/>Peace mode<br/>neighbour traffic on the mesh<br/>internet only to reach the Authority"]
  S1["<b>Stage 1: mobile network down, power up</b><br/>nodes switch to emergency mode<br/>router backbone carries all traffic<br/>phones attach over Wi-Fi / BLE<br/>captive portal for phones without the app"]
  S2["<b>Stage 2: power down</b><br/>routers dark<br/>phone-only BLE mesh for hours<br/>Android relays in background, iPhones in foreground<br/>store-and-forward: people walking carry messages between islands<br/>battery-backed routers remain as anchors"]
  S3["<b>Stage 3: gateways bridge islands</b><br/>satellite / generator-backed municipal sites<br/>check-ins and LIFE_CRITICAL events reach the Authority<br/>official alerts injected back into the mesh"]
  S0 -->|cells overloaded or cut| S1
  S1 -->|grid fails| S2
  S2 -->|gateway in range of any island| S3
  S3 -.->|recovery, hysteresis| S0
  style S0 fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf
  style S1 fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656
  style S2 fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450
  style S3 fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366
